      "status": "ok",
      "output": {
        "decision": "answer",
        "reason": "The evidence identifies the two shortcomings (overconfidence in predictions; incomplete/truncated transcripts when language models are used) and describes the corresponding practical solutions: for overconfidence, temperature-based smoothing of the prediction distribution combined with constraining EOS emission to within a narrow probability range of the most probable token; for incomplete transcripts, three strategies — restricting EOS emission to a narrow probability window, promoting longer transcripts (length-based term), and a coverage term counting frames with cumulative attention above a threshold to prevent looping. These address both named shortcomings."
      },
      "elapsed_ms": 3893.51050008554
    },
    {
      "stage": "Generate",
      "attempt": 1,
      "input": {
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "status": "ok",
      "citation_validation": {
        "id_valid": true,
        "source_consistent": true,
        "semantic_support": "not_evaluated"
      },
      "output": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "overconfidence_solution_eos_constraint",
            "text": "为解决模型过度自信问题，作者在不改变beam search代价的前提下，限制只在EOS token概率与最可能token概率处于较窄范围内时才输出EOS。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-10d1ebcc07738e41f14a4005"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "overconfidence_temperature_smoothing",
            "text": "作者比较了更尖锐和更平滑（温度调节）的分布设置，并指出温度升高时beam search能找到更好的解，但需注意防止产生截断的转写。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-10d1ebcc07738e41f14a4005"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "incomplete_transcripts_three_strategies",
            "text": "针对（使用语言模型时）不完整转写的问题，作者比较了三种防止不完整转写的策略。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "incomplete_eos_strategy_limitation",
            "text": "第一种策略不改变beam search准则，而是禁止在EOS概率不在最可能token概率设定范围内时输出EOS；该策略能防止截断，但对转写中间的遗漏效果不佳。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "incomplete_length_term",
            "text": "另一种做法是扩展beam search准则以鼓励更长的转写，即引入依赖转写长度的项，但此前报告称其使用困难，因为beam search会在录音的部分片段上循环而需要额外约束。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "incomplete_coverage_term",
            "text": "为防止循环，作者提出使用coverage项，统计累计注意力超过给定阈值的帧数。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "coverage_mechanism",
            "text": "coverage准则通过以下方式防止在话语上循环：一旦累计注意力越过阈值，该帧就被计为已选，之后再次选择该帧不会降低解码代价；实现中coverage在每次beam search迭代时用截至该步的全部注意力权重重新计算。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "reported_wer",
            "text": "这些实际解决方案在Wall Street Journal数据集上取得了有竞争力的说话人无关词错误率：不使用单独语言模型时为10.6% WER，结合三元语言模型时为6.7% WER。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-c1a01afddd733ef65ed6d199"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
